domain AgencyRequirementAcceptance:
  description "Record exact owner acceptance without changing reviewed requirement bytes."
problem P1:
  |
    The owner states: 要件として承認します。
evidence E1:
  |
    Requirement revision 1 digest remains
    f733f85a153349e4be28785fef05d93006d057e0e5d507a8423b658f9bb7f444,
    identical to the reviewed snapshot and owner-visible review input.
evidence E2:
  |
    The independent review is completed, with no established contradiction.
    Its report returned the unchanged snapshot to step 4 under REVIEW_THEN_DECIDE.
premise A1:
  |
    Owner acceptance is for requirements, not additional contract ADR acceptance,
    implementation, paid execution, deployment, push or expansion of scope.
    Review unknowns do not silently amend the accepted text.
pending U1:
  |
    Goal provenance, bounded reaction projection, legacy-field dispositions,
    generation configuration and accounting need detailed contract work.
    New implementation and model quality remain unverified.
premise OPTIONS:
  |
    A change the accepted document status inline, which changes reviewed bytes.
    B preserve its bytes and record exact acceptance separately.
decision D1 based_on P1, E1, E2, A1, U1, OPTIONS:
  |
    Use B: create an acceptance record with exact subject and review digests,
    owner quote and step-4 ACCEPT disposition. Preserve candidate and original
    review records as historical snapshots. Record remaining unknowns without
    making optional findings mandatory. Do not advance the combined ADR gate or
    perform runtime, Seal, plan, commit or external changes in this acceptance turn.
